    "claims": [
      {
        "key": "fever_dataset_size",
        "text": "《Unsupervised Question Answering for Fact-Checking》指出，FEVER 是最大的数据集，包含约 185k 条 claim，来源于 5.4M 篇 Wikipedia 文章的语料。",
        "citations": [
          {
            "paper_id": "1910.07154",
            "chunk_id": "c-ab6380532554bfd8cf2dc78b"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "clinical_no_fever",
        "text": "《Clinical Information Extraction via Convolutional Neural Network》未提及 FEVER 数据集；该论文研究的是来自 Mayo Clinic 的临床笔记与病理报告。",
        "citations": [
          {
            "paper_id": "1603.09381",
            "chunk_id": "c-09342b6b2a0eabec97459832"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "unsupervised_qa_label_acc",
        "text": "《Unsupervised Question Answering for Fact-Checking》报告的标签准确率为 80.2%（开发集）和 80.25%（测试集），并称在“SUPPORTS”标签上达到 80.2% 的标签准确率。",
        "citations": [
          {
            "paper_id": "1910.07154",
            "chunk_id": "c-7c69a28e7ffcb9ebd09842b6"
          },
          {
            "paper_id": "1910.07154",
            "chunk_id": "c-7d59a4589df766fa1261d8c6"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "unsupervised_qa_no_baseline_gap",
        "text": "所提供的《Unsupervised Question Answering for Fact-Checking》证据只给出绝对标签准确率，未说明相对基线的性能提升幅度数值。",
        "citations": [
          {
            "paper_id": "1910.07154",
            "chunk_id": "c-7c69a28e7ffcb9ebd09842b6"
          },
          {
            "paper_id": "1910.07154",
            "chunk_id": "c-7d59a4589df766fa1261d8c6"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "clinical_outperforms_baselines_qualitative",
        "text": "《Clinical Information Extraction via Convolutional Neural Network》称其方法在标准评估数据集上持续优于现有基线，并显著优于基线，但未给出具体提升数值。",
        "citations": [
          {
            "paper_id": "1603.09381",
            "chunk_id": "c-f45dc29ea469cc573133e3c9"
          },
          {
            "paper_id": "1603.09381",
            "chunk_id": "c-712a82e231bc15b7c11610b4"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "not_comparable",
        "text": "两篇论文涉及不同任务与数据集（事实核查的 FEVER 与临床信息抽取的临床笔记/病理报告），且仅有《Unsupervised Question Answering for Fact-Checking》提供数据集规模、两篇均未提供相对基线的具体提升数值，因此二者有关性能提升的回答不具可比性。",
